WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.400
How can you be more disciplined?
You probably think, well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.000
I have to do this and this and this&nbsp;
and this and that's where you're wrong.&nbsp;

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.240
It's not about you.
You have to do nothing.&nbsp;

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.600
Let me explain.
You have to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:21.720
nothing in your own little human power because by&nbsp;
yourself, on your own, you can accomplish nothing.&nbsp;

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:29.120
You cannot have effective 100% self-control in&nbsp;
every aspect of your life if you try to do it by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.920
yourself, because you are the problem.
